    "section_testimonials_yqM4cG": {
      "type": "section-testimonials",
      "blocks": {
        "testimonial_DFAe3K": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "star_rating": 5,
            "enable_border": false,
            "heading": "",
            "text_size": 125,
            "text": "<p>The Cloud Bed is amazing, and the blue cover looks so boujee and chic. It’s super comfy, and my mini poodle is obsessed, he can stretch out completely with so much room. The quality is top notch. I had a question about sizing, and customer service was super helpful. Delivery was really fast too. </p>",
            "customer_name": "Gabby Dunworth",
            "subheading": "<p><strong>✓ </strong>Verified customer</p>"
          }
        },
        "testimonial_xgxxcV": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "star_rating": 5,
            "enable_border": false,
            "heading": "",
            "text_size": 125,
            "text": "<p>A friend with a small dog recommended the Cloud Bed, and my jack russell, Rolo, is obsessed with it! The bolster is actually soft for him to rest his head on and the bed is low enough for him to hop on and off with his teeny legs - way better than other ones I've tried that are too thick, high and heavy. </p>",
            "customer_name": "Linda Hermann",
            "subheading": "<p><strong>✓ </strong>Verified Customer</p>"
          }
        },
        "testimonial_FNpkbV": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "star_rating": 5,
            "enable_border": false,
            "heading": "",
            "text_size": 125,
            "text": "<p>It's truly a piece of furniture, not at all like a dog crate. It looks perfect next to my bedside with the matching khaki bed, and my dog slept a full 8hrs straight the first night in it! He loves sleeping near us, but i just hated his old wire crate and bed in our room. So this is a massive upgrade. very happy!</p>",
            "customer_name": "Rachel K",
            "subheading": "<p><strong>✓ </strong>Verified customer</p>"
          }
        },
        "testimonial_d3R4aU": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "star_rating": 5,
            "enable_border": false,
            "heading": "",
            "text_size": 125,
            "text": "<p>When I was getting my new puppy, I didn’t have space for both a crate and a side table in my apartment, so the Koozi Crate was the perfect solution! It fits so well, and it looks sooo nice in my lounge room. I’ve styled it, and my pup loves hanging out in it. Totally worth the price.</p>",
            "customer_name": "Simone",
            "subheading": "<p><strong>✓ </strong>Verified customer</p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "testimonial_DFAe3K",
        "testimonial_xgxxcV",
